        <title>wdrop</title>
        <item>
            <title>0.1.3</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 17:07:05 +0800</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>4</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.1.3</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description xml:lang="zh-Hans"><![CDATA[<h3>新增</h3>
<ul><li>新增类目列表和模型页，可自定义类目并手动整理类目</li><li>确认「整理类目」后，会把最多 60 个条目的摘要发给通用模型</li></ul>
<h3>改进</h3>
<ul><li>智能分类默认不再包含剪贴板，钉住到库的条目按库的范围分类</li></ul>]]></description>
            <description xml:lang="en"><![CDATA[<h3>Added</h3>
<ul><li>Added Category List and Models pages, with custom categories</li><li>Suggest Categories sends up to 60 item summaries to your general model</li></ul>
<h3>Changed</h3>
<ul><li>Smart classification no longer includes the clipboard by default; pinned items follow the Library setting</li></ul>]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/yepyeel/wdrop-updates/releases/download/v0.1.3/wdrop-0.1.3.dmg" length="10825660" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="0ssjr42VK2IeE2nA4ZCFV7pOAcu+V4jTvnsKyMyDTfrpl32N+je6jVFAulpq1wMZrgPjY61KczewmkkP8vxBBQ=="/>
        </item>
        <item>
            <title>0.1.2</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 05 Nov 2026 13:08:59 +0800</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>3</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.1.2</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description xml:lang="zh-Hans"><![CDATA[<h3>新增</h3>
<ul><li>智能分类设置新增「打开控制台」，可在浏览器中管理 API Key 和账单</li></ul>
<h3>改进</h3>
<ul><li>精简设置页：已有条目的分类操作收成一行，检查更新移到版本号旁</li><li>默认开启自动检查更新，可在「通用」设置中关闭</li></ul>
<h3>修复</h3>
<ul><li>智能分类的「高级」现在点整行都能展开收起</li><li>剪贴板图片在列表和存储空间页不再显示空名称</li></ul>]]></description>
            <description xml:lang="en"><![CDATA[<h3>Added</h3>
<ul><li>Added Open Console to Smart Categories settings for managing API keys and billing</li></ul>
<h3>Changed</h3>
<ul><li>Tidied Settings: existing-item actions fit on one row and Check for Updates sits beside the version</li><li>Update checks are now on by default and can be turned off in General settings</li></ul>
<h3>Fixed</h3>
<ul><li>Advanced in Smart Categories settings now expands when you click anywhere on its row</li><li>Clipboard images no longer appear with a blank name in lists and Storage</li></ul>]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/yepyeel/wdrop-updates/releases/download/v0.1.2/wdrop-0.1.2.dmg" length="10562011" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="F9olb9GMwKUEQ/GFM7TXBgZHe/Bs0wse36DHwyzEbvVjd3QFmsw36swwcS8d++8wX4I2t70F8IjM+ubFP37cBw=="/>
        </item>
